<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>VO2max with Loaded Recovery</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Normal meal ~2h before. One bottle, 40-50g carbs. Done.

WARM-UP:
-20min building from Z1 to Z2

MAIN SET:
- 3x5min @ 115% FTP (Z5+, RPE 8-9), 3min recovery @ 50% FTP (Z1, RPE 3)
-Cadence: 90-100rpm on, 85-90rpm recovery
-Position: Seated throughout

COOL-DOWN:
-16min easy spin Z1-Z2

PROGRESSION:
-Level 1/6: Introductory - Focus on form and learning the workout pattern
-Learning the format - VO2 effort followed by tempo recovery, not Z1

EXECUTION:
-Ride the emitted 3x5min with 3min recovery. Do not add recovery beyond the prescribed structure.</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="1200" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.70" />
    <IntervalsT Repeat="3" OnDuration="300" OnPower="1.15" CadenceLow="90" CadenceHigh="100" OffDuration="180" OffPower="0.50" />
    <Cooldown Duration="960" PowerLow="0.70" PowerHigh="0.50" />
  </workout>
</workout_file>